          VIEW-AS FILL-IN 
          SIZE 14 BY 1
     tienelibro AT ROW 1.48 COL 48 WIDGET-ID 130
     frecursos AT ROW 2.52 COL 111 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 66
     BRECURSOS AT ROW 2.52 COL 130.2 WIDGET-ID 36
     texto_adic AT ROW 2.67 COL 3 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 136
     retira AT ROW 3.62 COL 87 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 126
     BLeyenda AT ROW 3.86 COL 109 WIDGET-ID 94
     v-certif AT ROW 4.1 COL 134 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 140
     Bvecino AT ROW 5.29 COL 109 WIDGET-ID 124
